#: ui/pages.slint:2930
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"Locked secrets are encrypted, and only the PIN opens them. If you forget "
"both the PIN and your master password, they can't be recovered, not even "
"with your emergency kit."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:2931
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
